## Fair Use Statement

This project includes quotations from copyrighted biblical translations and scholarly works under the fair use doctrine (17 U.S.C. § 107) for purposes of:
- Scholarship and research
- Commentary and criticism
- Teaching and education

All quoted materials are:
- Used in limited quantities
- Properly attributed to original sources
- Used in transformative ways for academic research
- Non-commercial in nature (repository is public research)

## Disclaimer

This repository is a research project and makes no theological claims. Ancient texts, translations, and interpretations are presented for scholarly purposes. Users should consult original sources and scholarly consensus for authoritative information.

The project maintainers make no warranty about the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any content. Use at your own discretion.

